OL,3,GNEWSAThe challenge facing Wales' first
OL,4,Aminister amid independence debate
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands marched through the streets
OL,7,Fof Aberystwyth and for the first time
OL,8,Fthey were joined by a first minister
OL,9,Fwho explicitly believed in their cause.
